    },
    {
      "claim": "The L4 intestinal absorption/permeability records are formulation, dissolution, and solubility studies for unrelated molecules (bifendate, CEP, OBB, EMD 57033, tetrabenazine, naftopidil, griseofulvin, hed) and provide no query-specific intestinal absorption or permeability measurement; they do not contradict the high prediction.",
